{"games":[{"id":79877593860968,"name":"KNIFE DUELS [BETA]","desc":"KNIFE DUELS 🔪\nFast-paced knife combat with kill streaks, and exclusive skins.\n\nFight other players in 1v1 Duels, Free For All, and Teams to earn XP from kills and level up.\nEarn coins with each level up that you can use to buy cases to unlock new knife skins.\n\nGame Modes:\n⚔️ 1v1 Duels\n🔥 Free For All\n👥 Team Duels\n\nProgression:\n⭐ Earn XP from kills\n💰 Get coins when you level up\n🎁 Open cases\n🔪 Collect knife skins\n📈 Build kill streaks\n\nProve your skill, grow your collection, and become one of the top duelists in the arena!\n\n👍 Like and ⭐ favorite the game if you enjoy it!","path":"/game/79877593860968-knife-duels","slug":"79877593860968-knife-duels","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6a7eb6667320824a35321e91e727f7da8692e5edf126d8d335ace30890906208.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2c86d09a0aac0da027ccffb7deae4723/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":396546,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-28T22:43:40.935Z","creator":{"name":"Knife Dueling","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":123516846332753,"name":"The Glass Bridge","desc":"ⓘ THIS GAME IS FINISHED AND WILL (most likely) NOT RECEIVE ANY MORE OFFICIAL UPDATES!\n\nStep into a faithful recreation of the iconic Glass Bridge from Netflix's Squid Game. Test your luck and courage as you race to cross before the 5-minute timer runs out!\n\nThe bridge is made of randomized tempered and normal glass. Step on the wrong tile and it will shatter beneath you while tempered glass will hold your weight. Earn 10 points for discovering a safe tile first and 1000 points for reaching the other side. Spend points on abilities like Push or Glass Checker, and climb onto global leaderboards!\n\nRecent Updates:\n• push & kick countering\n• revives\n\nUpcoming Updates:\n• CLIENT LAG FIX\n\nExploiters are banned permanently.","path":"/game/123516846332753-the-glass-bridg